      "values:originalText": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00184\n\n\n\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00184\n\nSchedule 1  Mergers and acquisitions",
      "skos:definition": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00184\n\n\n\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00184\n\nSchedule 1  Mergers and acquisitions",
